<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Atmel Corp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Atmel Corp raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it upgraded Atmel Corp to buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Late on Thursday, Atmel posted second quarter earnings of $0.27 a share, down from $0.50 a share last year.</p>
<p>-- Atmel gained 2-3/4 to 31-1/4.</p>
